### Prova ###
# The LuaLS editor pointer, rewritten whenever the suite runs. It holds machine-local absolute
# paths — the annotation dir, and a content-hashed plugin cache path per pinned plugin — so it
# is per-machine state, not shared source. `prova` (or `prova ide setup`) regenerates it.
# Prova's own plugin scaffold ignores it for the same reason.
/.luarc.json

